{"timestamp":"2026-09-23T23:33:29.157Z","ordinal":89639,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019f3c64-2576-70c2-90c0-e6b212f79ee1","turn_id":"01a0d09d-47a5-7db3-b179-80b63f2ed88a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-4d058a5b-4aac-47ed-b8f6-fdad36179ac0","process_id":"5485","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n -i 'Bundjil|alchemy|package-structure' /Users/cooper/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/Projects/bundjil","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n -i 'Bundjil|alchemy|package-structure' /Users/cooper/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md","query":"Bundjil|alchemy|package-structure","path":"MEMORY.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"1:# Task Group: TaxKit Alchemy/Effect/Doppler modernisation\n5:## Task 1: Alchemy/Effect/Doppler modernisation, locally verified but externally blocked\n9:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/3ebe/taxkit, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/09/23/rollout-2026-09-23T17-37-41-01a0cd32-ebb7-7b83-b8f7-9a9163ee513f.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-23T11:58:20+00:00, thread_id=01a0cd32-ebb7-7b83-b8f7-9a9163ee513f, PR #78 open; provider plan/merge blocked)\n13:- TaxKit, Alchemy beta.79, Effect rc.117, Doppler, Cloudflare.Website.Vite, `Plan: no resources`, `FAIL [doppler-custody] reason=scoped-token`, PR #78, workflow-plan-projection\n22:- Root `alchemy.run.ts` owns provider/state/stage composition; private source-only `@taxkit/infrastructure` owns the single `Cloudflare.Website.Vite(\"DocsWebsite\")` graph and stable identities. Implemented versions are Alchemy `2.0.0-beta.79`, Effect/platform/vitest `4.0.0-rc.117`, and Vitest `5.0.1`. [Task 1]\n33:scope: strict Effect, native Alchemy/Cloudflare Preview tracing, Axiom stage filtering, and bounded provider verification.\n44:- DAW, Alchemy beta.79, Effect rc.117, Cloudflare Preview, Axiom, `daw-production`, `preview-daw-production.coopercorbett.workers.dev`, `daw-axiom-traces`, patches/alchemy, e77d327\n48:- use strict Effect architecture, native Alchemy, Doppler-managed secrets, plain Australian English, explicit provider readback, and no unsupported completion claims. [Task 1]\n53:- Alchemy `2.0.0-beta.79` needs Effect `>=4.0.0-rc.115`; DAW uses rc.117 with matching platform/test packages. Native Preview support required the pinned patches `patches/alchemy@2.0.0-beta.79.patch` and `patches/@distilled.cloud%2Fcloudflare@1.0.0-rc.12.patch`. [Task 1]\n59:- Do not adopt an old Effect snapshot without checking Alchemy peer ranges. `alchemy dev` is cloud-connected and can create resources; use a UI-only command where provider state must not be touched. [Task 1]\n60:- If Preview tracing appears empty, inspect exported fields before naming filters: parent-worker plus hostname is the correct boundary. Prefer aggregate provider queries to broad raw-trace retrieval. A direct profile command hit `EPERM` on `.alchemy/profiles/default`; Doppler-injected CI/readback was reliable. [Task 1]\n74:- `/playground`, `signal-playground`, WebGL, Paper `01M0EBQNZC433VEC4B1KM6Z0XZ`, `2NM-0`, `2NN-0`, `2NP-0`, `2NQ-0`, shuffle, reduced motion, PR #126, Alchemy Production\n86:- PR #126 squash-merged as `01a4d74257692633f23875a626a377b336060482`; focused settings (including 400 shuffle save/restore rounds), five browser renderer tests, CI, native Alchemy Production deployment and live shuffle readback passed. [Task 1]\n614:- Keep the Vercel/Nitro MVP; a Cloudflare/Alchemy migration would replace deployment setup, add D1/migrations, move the domain and retest the `@vercel/og` route. Use invitation household, guest and submission-history records; preserve an RSVP even if notification delivery fails. [Task 1]\n652:scope: simplify duplicated Site deployment/verification machinery while retaining native Alchemy ownership, Releases, Changesets, Lighthouse and live proof boundaries.\n663:- Alchemy, deployment-verification-simplification, `bun alchemy deploy --stage prod --yes`, HGI-109, HGI-110, Knip, `SchemaError: Missing key at [\"exports\"]`, PR #118, `Engineer in Australia.`\n673:- Alchemy is the sole owner of Alchemy-managed Cloudflare/Axiom mutations. Current native deploy is `bun alchemy deploy --stage prod --yes`; Preview is `pr-<number>` and cleanup uses the exact named stage. Provider/public/telemetry proof remains separate from local checks or Alchemy exit status. [Task 1]\n1047:# Task Group: Learned Alchemy-native infrastructure lifecycle qualification\n1055:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/60f1/learned, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/archived_sessions/rollout-2026-09-08T11-33-25-01a07ea6-0997-7213-abb9-6a5dd5acddfa.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T05:55:56+00:00, thread_id=01a07ea6-0997-7213-abb9-6a5dd5acddfa, LNI-001–006 verified; LNI-007 review and LNI-008 live qualification pending)\n1059:- LNI-001, LNI-007, LNI-008, alchemy-native-lni008, Bun-1.3.14, Bun-1.4.0, `forceDestroy`, encrypted-state, exact-stage-cleanup, WCT-005\n1068:- Exact pins are Alchemy `808ef694b2e742a2bb76cb301da371e71421fa57`/`2.0.0-beta.75` and Effect `2600f62f4532026928454dcea8d1c48557b3f942`/`4.0.0-rc.112`; `.references/` clones are setup evidence, not runtime imports or provider proof. [Task 1]\n1070:- Native Alchemy plans are diagnostic, not immutable apply contracts. `alchemy-native-lni008` must not replace WCT-003 or touch WCT-005; unknown write outcomes require inspection, not replay. Non-empty R2 buckets require separately authorised, independently inventoried test-object deletion because the design avoids `forceDestroy`. [Task 1]\n1077:# Task Group: Site Alchemy deployment closeout and DNSSEC status\n1078:scope: verify merged Alchemy deployment closeout separately from Cloudflare TLS/DNSSEC propagation and monitor state.\n1085:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T06-43-06-mbdD-site_alchemy_closeout_and_dnssec_status.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/c2b4/site, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/archived_sessions/rollout-2026-09-07T16-43-06-01a07a9b-32de-73c1-a92e-20488e1d2bd9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T05:46:21+00:00, thread_id=01a07a9b-32de-73c1-a92e-20488e1d2bd9, PR #116/#117 merged; production workflow passed)\n1089:- Alchemy, `alchemy.state.run.ts`, PR-116, PR-117, `tmp/cloudflare-command-receipts`, Production workflow 34179974773\n1095:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T06-43-06-mbdD-site_alchemy_closeout_and_dnssec_status.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/c2b4/site, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/archived_sessions/rollout-2026-09-07T16-43-06-01a07a9b-32de-73c1-a92e-20488e1d2bd9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T05:46:21+00:00, thread_id=01a07a9b-32de-73c1-a92e-20488e1d2bd9, TLS active; DNSSEC parent DS pending; monitor paused)\n1108:- Use `alchemy.state.run.ts` for state reads. The receipt-writer path is repository-root `tmp/cloudflare-command-receipts`, not `packages/scripts/tmp/...`; production plan digests are recalculated plan summaries, not immutable saved plans. [Task 1]\n1405:- `Plan DAW repository scaffold`, `01a0c76f-4d39-7fd1-be85-179516a91a0b`, `gpt-6-astra`, repo-structure, strict-effect-ts, Doppler, Alchemy, Cloudflare\n1627:# Task Group: Site Alchemy Production cutover and redesign handoff\n1628:scope: evidence-gated Alchemy/Cloudflare Production cutover, fresh-plan approval, and a separate redesign handoff; local plans and partial provider state are not completion.\n1635:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/Projects/site, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T14-47-35-01a06fe4-b921-74f3-9f74-be9c9e2b337b.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-07T06:43:56+00:00, thread_id=01a06fe4-b921-74f3-9f74-be9c9e2b337b, cutover incomplete; redesign task queued)\n1639:- Alchemy, CloudflareProductionPlanError, coopercorbett.com, www redirect, e5053ad2364d73d0e2c13a2e22e33461dc1096856035ed51041b874bae468473, alchemy.state.run.ts, cloudflare-command-receipts\n1645:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/Projects/site, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T14-47-35-01a06fe4-b921-74f3-9f74-be9c9e2b337b.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-07T06:43:56+00:00, thread_id=01a06fe4-b921-74f3-9f74-be9c9e2b337b, redesign handoff; no implementation)\n1649:- prd-writer, prd-review, alchemy/Test/Bun, Test.make, plan-output.boundary.ts, ProductionPlanSummary, workflow-contract.test.ts\n1658:- Site’s Production graph is Alchemy-owned; use `alchemy.state.run.ts` for state-only checks. Direct Cloudflare/Axiom access is for independent post-deployment proof, not mutation. Native deploy recalculates the plan. [Task 1]\n1659:- The new task `Review and redesign Alchemy deployments` is queued, not complete. Preserve credential/isolation/rollback/evidence controls, but replace formatted-TUI parsing and summary-only plan hashing with an evidence-led design informed by upstream `alchemy/Test/Bun`/`Test.make`. [Task 2]\n2021:# Task Group: TaxKit Alchemy and Effect v4 infrastructure ownership\n2022:scope: accepted-spec implementation of private infrastructure ownership, one Alchemy composition root, provider-free checks and proof-boundary reporting.\n2025:## Task 1: Implement Alchemy/Effect v4 infrastructure ownership SPEC, locally verified\n2029:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/2a2e/taxkit, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/08/31/rollout-2026-08-31T18-05-41-01a056da-48be-7bd2-9dc9-2509351489d0.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:44:04+00:00, thread_id=01a056da-48be-7bd2-9dc9-2509351489d0, full local verification; no provider/release action)\n2033:- @taxkit/infrastructure, alchemy.run.ts, Cloudflare.Website.Vite, docs-deployment:check, referencePolicy, OpenAPI Encoded, bun run verification\n2042:- Keep `@taxkit/infrastructure` private/source-only and `alchemy.run.ts` to typed ingress, stage/provider/state composition, named stacks and bounded outputs. Preserve the single `Cloudflare.Website.Vite(\"DocsWebsite\")` lifecycle; do not add a second deployment path. [Task 1]\n2052:# Task Group: Bundjil TypeScript 7 and Effect tsgo migration\n2054:applies_to: cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/8a9e/bundjil; reuse_rule=toolchain/config lessons are reusable; branch, secret wrapper and delivery state are checkout-specific.\n2060:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/8a9e/bundjil, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/08/31/rollout-2026-08-31T22-59-28-01a057e7-41d4-7582-a388-5acd4feeb742.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:05:56+00:00, thread_id=01a057e7-41d4-7582-a388-5acd4feeb742, clean verification; worktree dirty and not delivered)\n2064:- TypeScript 7.0.2, @effect/tsgo 0.38.0, oxlint-tsgolint, effect-tsgo patch --oxlint, @effect/language-service, Spectrum, doppler run --project bundjil\n2073:- `apps/agent` build requires `doppler run --project bundjil --config dev -- bun run build`; the same wrapper made all 15 verification tasks pass. Warning/suggestion severities are intentionally off until their ownership is bounded; correctness errors remain on. [Task 1]\n2108:# Task Group: Learned versus Site Alchemy/Doppler architecture review\n2112:## Task 1: Investigate Alchemy, Stacks, packages and Doppler, report only\n2116:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/Projects/learned, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/archived_sessions/rollout-2026-08-31T23-40-37-01a0580c-edea-73a2-82e4-a969cbd7ebd6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T01:35:03+00:00, thread_id=01a0580c-edea-73a2-82e4-a969cbd7ebd6, approved SPEC branch pushed; implementation queued)\n2120:- alchemy.run.ts, @learned/infrastructure, Stack, encrypted-local-state.ts, connect-run.ts, Doppler, stage isolation, WorkOS, reverse package-to-app dependency\n2128:- Site’s useful pattern is a thin root `alchemy.run.ts`, semantic infrastructure package, named stacks, typed outputs and fixed Doppler configurations. Learned’s encrypted state, allowlists, narrow child environments, Effect deadlines/cleanup, Schema decoding and redaction are safety controls to preserve. [Task 1]\n2135:# Task Group: Site Alchemy Cloudflare Production domain cutover\n2136:scope: move coopercorbett.com and www.coopercorbett.com ownership, DNS/TLS, and canonical redirect into Alchemy; distinguish a validated plan or HTTP response from completed provider ownership and redirect behaviour.\n2139:## Task 1: Production Alchemy domain cutover, blocked\n2143:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/533c/site, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/08/31/rollout-2026-08-31T12-25-19-01a055a2-ad19-78c3-9fae-968b4a45e06e.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T15:00:43+00:00, thread_id=01a055a2-ad19-78c3-9fae-968b4a45e06e, pre-redirect state verified; Cloudflare MFA blocks completion)\n2147:- Alchemy, Cloudflare, coopercorbett.com, www.coopercorbett.com, canonical redirect, DNS, TLS, MFA, account-owned-token, user-owned-token, cloudflare-production:deploy, CloudflareCommandProgressError\n2156:- The final blocked worktree was clean at `fd3e41ed62e60c58d4a2a065789275d04dfa5abb`. The Alchemy deploy verified the Production plan (`2 to update, 2 to delete, 21 to noop`) then exited at the redirect-rule operation. [Task 1]\n2158:- Apex and `www` both returned HTTPS 200, but `www` did not redirect. HTTP 200 is response proof only, not canonical-redirect or Alchemy-ownership proof. [Task 1]\n2526:- thread-status, Main task, list_threads, limit <=50, read_thread, send_message_to_thread, Pollsor, Bundjil, TaxKit, Adad\n2534:- Current Main IDs: Pollsor `019f8aa7-011d-7781-950d-4d8b979fc877`; Bundjil `019f3c64-2576-70c2-90c0-e6b212f79ee1`; TaxKit `019f663b-6195-7130-8d2a-6bf5aaf24a8b`; Adad `019f75f4-3ce3-7873-aaa7-2813a5176054`. Verify project/cwd with direct read before messaging. [Task 1]\n2570:scope: accepted, secret-negative Doppler cutover plan for Adad; implementation is blocked at active Alchemy ownership and 1Password unlock.\n2591:- Separate ordinary config, Doppler secrets, Alchemy state, Sta