it `retain()` despite destructive default removal (ALC-002). Follow with provider-backed capacity/account checks, root-span dashboard predicates, removal of retired graph resources, narrow child-process environment, and a smaller provider DTO boundary. [Task 8]\n5018:- The proposed hardening package is `docs/product-specs/alchemy-axiom-iac-hardening/{SPEC.md,tasks.json}` with index entry under `## Proposed Intent`. It maps `ALC-001`–`ALC-008` to `AAIH-001`–`AAIH-008`; the documented schema requires exactly one matching index row and explicit per-task verification/impact details. [Task 9]\n5032:# Task Group: TaxKit release train and Cloudflare/Alchemy docs deployment\n5036:## Task 1: Repository-local versioning and accepted Alchemy correction SPEC, partial\n5044:- TaxKit, Changesets, version-repo, release:check, private packages, Alchemy, ADS-001, ADS-004, Cloudflare.Website.Vite, bootstrap, 0751c49\n5046:## Task 2: TaxKit Cloudflare/Alchemy deployment closeout, partial\n5050:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/e85995a3-f338-409c-b3f3-a651dc076ad9/taxkit, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/archived_sessions/rollout-2026-07-29T03-09-02-019fa9b3-85d5-7992-9336-02e46bc65f43.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-10T04:43:04+00:00, thread_id=019fa9b3-85d5-7992-9336-02e46bc65f43, Cloudflare/Alchemy deployment implementation and lifecycle closeout merged)\n5054:- TaxKit, apps/docs, Alchemy, Cloudflare, Preview, DocsBuild, DocsWebsite, exact-SHA, mapfile, printf, workflow.contract.test.ts, provider-plan\n5056:## Task 5: Implement and close the accepted Alchemy deployment structure SPEC, completed\n5060:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/6c17/taxkit, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/08/24/rollout-2026-08-24T10-59-07-01a03147-3e29-7cf0-9a45-92b512183790.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-24T05:30:23+00:00, thread_id=01a03147-3e29-7cf0-9a45-92b512183790, merged and closed)\n5073:- when the user asks to “spin up a subthre