{"timestamp":"2026-09-23T23:44:42.636Z","ordinal":90332,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_096c433c75860d41016ab4646407e48191bb256b635ee00aa1","status":"completed","call_id":"call_r5zjHF7nIevQ0w5fTFmCh9U4","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/Projects/bundjil/docs/architecture/repo-structure.md\\n@@\\n-  infrastructure/     Private Alchemy resources, providers, state-safe contracts.\\n+  infrastructure/     Private Alchemy resources, providers, state-safe contracts.\\n+    src/stacks/        Stage-aware Alchemy resource declarations.\\n@@\\n-alchemy.run.ts         Root Alchemy stack router; no provider transport details.\\n-packages/infrastructure/src/stacks/  Stage-aware Alchemy resource declarations.\\n+alchemy*.run.ts        Thin Alchemy entrypoints; no provider transport details.\\n@@\\n - keeps root Alchemy entrypoints thin and its resource declarations behind\\n   `@bundjil/infrastructure/stack`; provider clients remain private to their\\n   owning adapters, and Vercel Git deployment\\n   ownership outside Alchemy configuration reconciliation;\\n+- keeps operator commands under `packages/infrastructure/scripts/**` rather\\n+  than in the root Alchemy graph. Unlike Site's Cloudflare Website graph,\\n+  Bundjil also has adopted Vercel and Photon resources, report-only drift,\\n+  and a Git-owned deployment path. Those capabilities must not be folded into\\n+  one deployment declaration merely to match Site's smaller layout;\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/Projects/bundjil/docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md\\n@@\\n `bun run check:docs` validates current metadata, links, indexes, lifecycle,\\n documented commands, package README coverage, successor routes, portability,\\n and owner-aware contradictions. It writes bounded console diagnostics and full\\n JSON detail to `tmp/docs-policy-report.json`.\\n+It does not pin one dated Alchemy merge receipt to every later commit; that\\n+receipt remains preserved as historical evidence, while current owners and\\n+paths remain checked.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0d09d-47a5-7db3-b179-80b63f2ed88a","create_time":1790207060.410251}}}
